### Test GET /random - Without token
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/quotes/random

### Test GET /random - With valid token (replace TOKEN with actual token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/quotes/random
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN

### Test GET /random - With invalid token
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/quotes/random
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here